{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"뒤집기","desc":"<p>벡터의 순서를 뒤집어 돌려주는 <code>reverse_vector(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"reverse_vector <- function(x) {\n  rev(x)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>rev()</code> 함수예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"reverse_vector(c(1, 2, 3))","expected":[3,2,1],"visible":true},{"call":"reverse_vector(c(\"a\", \"b\"))","expected":["b","a"],"visible":true},{"call":"reverse_vector(5)","expected":5,"visible":false},{"call":"reverse_vector(numeric(0))","expected":[],"visible":false}],"starter":"reverse_vector <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-322"}